<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">KƆL - Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">KƆLƆSAY</para>
  <para style="toc1">Un'kaan akà Akɔlɔsay</para>
  <para style="toc2">KƆLƆSAY</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kɔl</para>
  <para style="mt2">Un'kaan akà</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akɔlɔsay</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɔlɔsay làkäl bul mwɛy là Azi Minɔ̈ɔ̈r, ŋàbà bàfàbel naa Türki, tsütsü a Ɛfɛsɔ kà isii a kilɔmɛtrɛ nkam yweel. Ikaswaŋà naa Pɔl bul alà kàtöl anki akà ikikye. Ɛpafras, un'nsi Kɔlɔsay nde ŋakwo, umwɛy uboo a asyääl ande, kàkäl mbuur atàtwɛb musyen Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ kwo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Abun, Pɔl kàkäl mbuur a bɔlokà mbalà yumwɛy u Lɔmà. Ɛpafras kàyi mukun'kyään naa baar a Kɔlɔsay bàbilà uboo a an'lɔɔŋ a akyään a an'lɔɔŋ akün. Akyään abà bàyilɔŋà naa muyöb Nzam anà muwà mɔ̈ɔ̈, bàtàkömà bàngwal a an'dweelà, ukyey nkyɛɛy anà nswɛɛŋ a ngwalàngwal, unsà ndaa iler isa adyà, man ... Pa bun'kyään ndaa a mpay ayi, ntööm kàsöön baar a Kɔlɔsay mukayɔɔb naa mɔ̈ɔ̈ ufàpà Nzam amu Yɛsu Klistɔ wàŋàkwo mbɔɔn a mbɔɔn. Nde waa katööm mbalà yumwɛy a Tishik anà Ɔnɛsim. Un'kaan awà wàŋàkab itiir itär:</para>
  <para style="ip">Itiir atàtwɛb kyàmuswaŋ ikɔ̈b a Klistɔ: nde wà udu a ngwal a an'dweelà yanswà, anà nde mpɛl awà Mfum a Ikööŋ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Itiir kyàyweel: ntööm wàmusà baar a Kɔlɔsay unsà igyɛɛŋ ntɔn ibii a baar asin bàmuyipay akà ba.</para>
  <para style="ip">Itiir kyà ntsüü kyàmuswaŋ nkääl a mɔ̈ɔ̈ akün yan'kwo mukal unsà un'tüüb anà Klistɔ, uboo a ikööŋ a Klistɔ kyaŋakwo, uboo a bɔr itàkal uboo a baar banswà.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ntsülà yàmuswaŋ akyeey a mbɔɔn a mbɔɔn anà mbɔr aŋàsɔn u kɔɔ a ntööm ŋakwo.</para>
  <para style="ip">An'lɔɔŋ an'be man'kwo màsɔɔm ifà anà isin a paŋà làmwɛy anà lumwɛy. Wɛɛ ma mun'tüüb mwɛy: ma màfàpà aklistɔ mpiim unsà làkwikilà aba amu Klistɔ mwɛy. Kyakin, ntääŋ a un'kaan akà baar a Kɔlɔsay yà ndaa mwɛy yipepey: ya ifàtɛn ngwalngwal ikɔ̈b a ngyee a Klistɔ, nde mbuur afàbeen asɔ a an'dweelà.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1"/>Pɔl, ntööm a Yɛsu Klistɔ, unsà ukwen a Nzam, anà un'tɔŋ Tumàtɛ awà tsütsü apà mɛ, mɛ an'pà mbɔr <verse eid="COL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2"/>akà aŋin'kyɛɛl abà u bul a Kɔlɔsay abà atɔŋ abi unsà un'tüüb aba amu Klistɔ: wɛy kab a ngway anà duu a Nzam, Taaràbi, màkäl anà bɛ!<verse eid="COL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyamàkà a an'tɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3"/>Bi ifuur an'tɔɔn akà Nzam, Taar a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ, unsà ngyamàkà mpa ifàyɔn bi mupà akà nde ntɔn bɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4"/>Bi kàwem làkwikilà abɛ amu Yɛsu Klistɔ anà ukwen làbà bɛ abà ntɔn aŋin'kyɛɛl banswà. <verse eid="COL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5"/>Bya byan'fà unsà làkyän alà u du ntɔn bɛ, làkyän làyöb bɛ u mbwo a ndaa a ndandaa ayà Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ alà làkɔlà akà bɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6"/>La làpää u mɛɛn manswà, waa làbör imbɛŋ, ifà imwɛy sye ufàkyer nde amu bɛ fà ilä làwɛl bɛ anà làyöb bɛ kab a Nzam unsà ndandaa ande, <verse eid="COL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7"/>asànaa naa kàlalɔŋ Ɛpafras. Nde wà un'baay a isal ifàkwen bi, un'syääl a lää wà Klistɔ. <verse eid="COL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8"/>Nde mbuur kikyään naa ukwen nà Dweelà we abà uboo a bɛ.<verse eid="COL 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9"/>Kyakin, akà bi, fà ilä kàwem bi abà, bi kàyɔ̈n anki muyamà ntɔn bɛ. Bi kan'lɔm akà Nzam mukàlapà, u mbwo a Dweelà ande, an'yeerà anà un'yɛnà ntɔn muyöb ukwen ande. <verse eid="COL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10"/>Abun, bɛ làsàkal anà nkääl aŋàkwo akà Mwol ntɔn mukun'pà un'sak taaŋ lanswà. Amu ya, bɛ làsàkyer ndaa aŋàbwaŋ, làsàbɔr mbɛŋ ifà ifà anà làsàkal u ngyööb a Nzam yà ndandaa. <verse eid="COL 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11"/>Ngwal a làkoo ande isàlabuul bàngwal amu ya yanswà, ntɔn bɛ làkwe mukaŋ mpem u ndaa yanswà anà làsi muküünà tii u ntsüü unsà un'sak. <verse eid="COL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12"/>Làfuur an'tɔɔn akà Taa awà kàlasi bàŋàkwo muwal kab uboo a kwal a aŋin'kyɛɛl u pɛɛlà. <verse eid="COL 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13"/>Nde kitsü mɔ̈ɔ̈ unsà ikɔ̈b a mpib anà nde kibiil uboo a imwol a Mwan ande wànkween. <verse eid="COL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14"/>Amu nde bi ibà aŋàbeen, man'be abi màŋàdwääl.<verse eid="COL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imbuur anà isal a Klistɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15"/>Mwan awà wà idiim a Nzam mpa bàfàman u mii. Nde wà Mwan atàtwɛb u nkyeer yanswà, <verse eid="COL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16"/>ntɔn indiir byanswà bàkyer amu nde, u du anà u mɛɛn, abyà ifàmɛnà anà mpa byàfàmɛnà, An'kir Imwol, Amfum, Aŋikɔ̈b anà Aŋangwal, indiir byanswà bàkyer amu nde anà ntɔn nde, <verse eid="COL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17"/>anà nde wà kusà a indiir byanswà, amu nde indiir byanswà byà kà ikal abya. <verse eid="COL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18"/>Nde wà un'tswe a ndür ayà Ikööŋ, un'bään wàtàtwɛb uboo a akü, ntɔn muwal ikal atàtwɛb, amu indiir byanswà. <verse eid="COL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19"/>Ntɔn Nzam kàkwen naa inzaam ande kyanswà iyööl Mwan ande, <verse eid="COL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20"/>anà u mbwo a nde, nde ufuur un'tüüb ande anà indiir byanswà, u mɛɛn anà u du, musà duu u mbwo a an'kil a kulunsi ande amu nde anà ntɔn nde.<verse eid="COL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21"/>Kyekà, itaan bɛ làkäl angyey anà ayiiŋ a Nzam unsà an'kyän anà unsa isal abɛ byà ube. <verse eid="COL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22"/>Wɛɛ apanà, Nzam kan'fuur un'tüüb ande anà bɛ u mbwo a ndür a imbuur a Mwan ande yàkü ntɔn mukàlamɛɛy bàŋin'kyɛɛl kusà ande, ukɔɔn too anà an'pɛl. <verse eid="COL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23"/>Wɛɛ ilɔɔmà naa, u mbwo a làkwikilà, bɛ làkäl bàngwal anà bàŋàtsim, ukɔɔn akal bàŋàkaabà anà làkyän a Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ alà làwem bɛ, alà bàkyään akà ikyeer kyanswà u mɛɛn, anà amu la, mɛ, Pɔl, akyàbulà un'syääl.<verse eid="COL 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isal a Pɔl ntɔn Ikööŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24"/>Mpalàbà, mɛ an'man un'sak unsà mpay an'fuur mɛ ayà ntɔn bɛ, ntɔn mɛ in'wàmukölà u ndür amɛ nkɔ̈ɔ̈n ayà u mpay aŋàsöön a Klistɔ, ntɔn ndür ande ayà Ikööŋ, <verse eid="COL 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25"/>ntɔn kya, mɛ akyàbulà un'syääl u mbwo a buur kan'pɛ Nzam ntɔn bɛ: mukyään ubwaŋàbwaŋ ndaa a Nzam, <verse eid="COL 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26"/>ndaa yàkäl ngyee fà itaan anà kàmɛɛy nde mpalàbà akà aŋin'kyɛɛl ande. <verse eid="COL 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27"/>Nde kàkwen mukaswaŋ naa un'naaŋ a làkoo nà awà uboo a ngyee ayi ntɔn baar mpa abà Ayudà: Klistɔ amu bɛ, iswaŋà naa bɛ làbye anà làkyän muwal kab unsà làkoo a Nzam. <verse eid="COL 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28"/>Nde awà bi ifàkyään, ifàweey anà ifàlɔŋ mbuur wanswà unsà an'yeerà manswà, ntɔn mubuul mbuur wanswà ukäl aŋàyɛl amu Klistɔ. <verse eid="COL 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29"/>Kyakin in'fàsal mɛ anà in'fànwaan mɛ anà un'swey a ngwal ande awà afàsal a unkaak a ngwal amu mɛ.<verse eid="COL 1:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1"/>Abun, mɛ in'kwen bɛ làyöb naa bwoor a ità nà mɛ in'fànwaan ntɔn bɛ, ntɔn baar a Lawɔdisɛ, anà ntɔn baar banswà mpa abàŋàtaman akà ikikye, <verse eid="COL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2"/>abà, mɛ in'kwen naa mpem aba ikäl yà un'kanà, anà ba bàkäl bàŋàtüüb unsà ukwen, bàbilà uboo a un'naaŋ ande wanswà, bàyöl a un'yɛnà ntɔn bàyöb ngyee a Nzam, ikaswaŋà naa Klistɔ. <verse eid="COL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3"/>Un'naaŋ a an'yeerà anà ngyööb byàŋàyee amu nde. <verse eid="COL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4"/>An'tɛn mɛ abà ntɔn mbuur ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akàlakur a ntweey a ntsà yà loor. <verse eid="COL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5"/>Ntɔn itàkal naa unsà imbuur mɛ tsütsü watɛy anà bɛ, wɛɛ unsà dweelà, mɛ in'wà anà bɛ, mɛ in'wà unsà un'sak muman naa bɛ làbàŋàtsim unsà làkwikilà amu Klistɔ.<verse eid="COL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Klistɔ mpɛl afàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6"/>Abun, asànaa làkyey bɛ Klistɔ Yɛsu asànaa Mwol, làkäl un'tüüb anà nde. <verse eid="COL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7"/>Abà, làkäl aŋàsà in'swɛy anà aŋàtɔŋ amu nde, làkäl aŋàtsim unsà làkwikilà asànaa bàlalɔŋ la, anà làkäl bàŋàsöön unsà ngyamàkà a an'tɔɔn.<verse eid="COL 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8"/>Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ, ntɔn mbuur ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akàlalɛɛ mbwaar a ntweey a ntsà, wɛɛ ya kàyà ndandaa anki, anà an'yeerà a loor màfàfà unsà imbuur, anà unsà ngwal ifàyaal mɛɛn, wɛɛ kà akà Klistɔ anki. <verse eid="COL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9"/>Ntɔn ngyööl a Nzam yanswà yà u ndür ande, <verse eid="COL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10"/>anà bɛ, bɛ làbà aŋàyɔl amu mbuur awà un'tswe a Imfum kyanswà anà Ikɔ̈b kyanswà.<verse eid="COL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11"/>Amu nde sye waa bàlakyɛy, kà nkyɛɛy ayà ufàkyer kɔɔ a mbuur anki, wɛɛ nkyɛɛy a Klistɔ ayà ifàtsuuŋ imbuur abi kyà man'be. <verse eid="COL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12"/>Bɛ bàladye anà nde u ndüümà, bàlawiiy sye anà nde, u mbwo a làkwikilà amu unkaak a ngwal a Nzam awà kun'wiiy uboo a akü. <verse eid="COL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13"/>Bɛ, bɛ baar abà làkäl aŋàkwà ntɔn mbii abɛ anà ukɔɔn nkyɛɛy a ndür abɛ, Nzam kàlapɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà nde. Nde kidwääl nkul a mbii abi yanswà. <verse eid="COL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14"/>Nde kàdwä un'kɔɔn a ikwàndwà abi anà nswɛɛŋ awa, nde kàpiy wa, waa kàbɛɛrà wa u kulunsi. <verse eid="COL 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15"/>Abun, Amfum anà Aŋikɔ̈b, nde kasi ipɔl ipɔl, kamɛɛy ibaŋ u mii a baar banswà, kasi unsà un'lwaaŋ a iböŋ a kulunsi.<verse eid="COL 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16"/>Abun, wɛy naa akà mbuur mwɛy ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akàlatsüül mbar ntɔn isaa anà man, itàkal ntɔn un'kyɔm, ntɔn mukyɛɛl nsöŋ akün, itàkal saba: <verse eid="COL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17"/>Abin byanswà byà munii a indiir byàlàyà, wɛɛ ndandaa abya yà amu Klistɔ. <verse eid="COL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18"/>Twon lan'pà mbwo naa bàlatsüül mbar akà baar bàfàmɛnà naa ba bà baar a làbɔ̈ɔ̈n anà bàfàsà ngyamàkà akà akyeey. Ba bàŋàbilà afwee unsà imɛɛy aba ŋakwo. Ntɔn an'kyän a imbuur aba, ba bàŋàyam a uyɔl bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n ndöŋ. <verse eid="COL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19"/>Ba kà bàŋàbääb anki akà Klistɔ awà un'tswe. Kyeka, u mbwo a un'tswe waa ndür yanswà ifàwal isaa anà yàŋàtüüb a deŋ deŋ a an'kör anà nkɔn, anà in'tay unsà ngyɛɛl aya ufun'pà Nzam.<verse eid="COL 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwà anà ukal anà Klistɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20"/>Kya isàkal naa bɛ làkü anà Klistɔ, anà làkyàtsuŋà unsà indiir byàfàyaal mɛɛn mà, ntɔn nkye lan'fàkyey bɛ nswɛɛŋ asànaa bɛ làfàkal kà an'kɔɔ a mɛɛn: <verse eid="COL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21"/>« Twon an'dyà undiir wà », « Twon an'kyee undiir wunà », « Twon an'ba wa ». <verse eid="COL 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22"/>Nswɛɛŋ ayi yà ntɔn indiir abyà ifàtay ungö musyääl bya. Ya yà nswɛɛŋ anà an'lɔɔŋ a imbuur. <verse eid="COL 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23"/>Inye, nswɛɛŋ ayi ifàmɛnà asànaa ya ye anà an'yeerà, ntɔn ya ifàlɔm naa mbuur mbuur usi ngyamàkà asànaa ukwen mpem ande, anà làbɔ̈ɔ̈n a loor, anà upɛ ndür ande ŋakwo mpay. Wɛɛ ya ndöŋ yatɛy, ntɔn ya ifàpà ilään a ndür mpɛl.<verse eid="COL 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1"/>Abun, isàkal naa bɛ làkyàwiyà anà Klistɔ, làleŋ indiir a du, ikal awà Klistɔ, awà wàŋàbwaay u kɔɔ a ibaal a Nzam. <verse eid="COL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2"/>Làpɛ an'kyän abɛ unsà indiir a du, wɛɛ kà unsà byàmɛɛn anki. <verse eid="COL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3"/>Ntɔn, bɛ làkyàkwà, mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ wàŋàyee uboo a Klistɔ, amu Nzam. <verse eid="COL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4"/>Mpal usàmɛnà Klistɔ awà mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ, apan, bɛ sye làsàmɛnà anà nde, unsà làkoo ande.<verse eid="COL 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɔ̈ɔ̈ itaan anà wàkün</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5"/>Làdwä indiir a mɛɛn byanswà u mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ: ipasàsɛ, ŋingyäy, ilään, làmfɛɛl, anà unkaam abà itɛk. <verse eid="COL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6"/>Indiir a tub abi ifàgyool nkyɛl a Nzam udu a baan un'tswe ngwal. <verse eid="COL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7"/>Le nkääl làkäl bɛ anà ya, mpal làkäl bɛ uboo a mɔ̈ɔ̈ awun.<verse eid="COL 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8"/>Wɛɛ mpalàbà, bɛ sye, làkɔɔb indiir abi byanswà: nkyɛl, itsumbuun, ful, ntwee anà ndaa a kɔɔrà abyà byàfàtoo u mun abɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9"/>Twon lan'kur bɛ a bɛ, ntɔn bɛ làkyàkɔɔb imbuur abɛ kyà itaan anà nsyääl akya, <verse eid="COL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10"/>anà bɛ làkyàbwaar mbuur akün awà afàbwool taaŋ lanswà uboo a ngyööb asaŋaa isii a Nkyer ande. <verse eid="COL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11"/>Abun, mbuur mpa awà Un'yudà itàkal naa Un'yudà ufàkal anki, itàkal bàŋàkyɛy anà bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n aŋàkyɛy, itàkal mbuur a mbuur anà kimbuur, itàkal un'sɔ anà mbuur a nsaay, wɛɛ Klistɔ: nde wà ya yanswà amu baar banswà.<verse eid="COL 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12"/>Ntɔn bɛ làbà aŋàsɔɔl, bà in'kyɛɛl, bànkwen akà Nzam, abun làkäl anà mpem aŋàbwaŋ, mpem a ngyɛb, ukwen, làbɔ̈ɔ̈n, anà nkääŋ a mpem. <verse eid="COL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13"/>Làkäl anà nkääŋ a mpem bɛ a bɛ, kya isàkal naa umwɛy uboo a bɛ we anà ikɔk a ndaa anà wumwɛy, làdwääl nkul bɛ a bɛ, asànaa kàladwääl Klistɔ, làkyer abun sye bɛ a bɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14"/>Unsà ya yanswà, làkäl anà ukwen, wa wà asànaa un'siŋ a ngwal ufàlatüüb. <verse eid="COL 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15"/>Wɛy duu a Klistɔ làyaal mpem abɛ, duu alà bàlabel bɛ banswà ntɔn mutɔŋ ndür mwɛy. Làyöb mufuur an'tɔɔn. <verse eid="COL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16"/>Wɛy ndaa a Klistɔ anà un'naaŋ aya wanswà ikäl amu bɛ! Làlɔŋàkà anà làweey amwɛy anà bumwɛy unsà an'yeerà manswà. Làtɔ̈ɔ̈l Nzam an'diim u mpem abɛ wanswà anà mfuur an'tɔɔn, u mbwo a an'diim, ikwɛŋ, anà an'diim ufàpà Dweelà. <verse eid="COL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17"/>Undiir wanswà lan'kwo bɛ mutɛn itàkal mukyer, làkyer wa kà ikɔb a Mwol Yɛsu, unsà mfuur an'tɔɔn akà Taa Nzam u mbwo a nde.<verse eid="COL 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkääl akün uboo a bɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18"/>Akaar, lawem adim abɛ, asànaa abà ukwen a Mwol.<verse eid="COL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19"/>Abaal, lakwen akyay abɛ, twon lan'kal anà itsumbuun akà ba.<verse eid="COL 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20"/>Baan, làkäl anà unkyeey akà aböör abɛ unsà indiir byanswà, ntɔn ya ifàpà un'sak akà Mwol.<verse eid="COL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21"/>Bàtaa, twon lan'pà baan abɛ unkiiŋ, manà ba bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n ayàkal anà un'kanà.<verse eid="COL 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22"/>Asɔ, làkäl anà unkyeey akà ankum abɛ unsà indiir byanswà u mɛɛn pà. Làkyer abun, kà nà u mpal bàlaseyà ba anki, asànaa bɛ làleŋà mupà un'sak akà baar, wɛɛ kà unsà mpem yweel anki, ntɔn bɛ làfàtiin Mwol bɔɔmà. <verse eid="COL 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23"/>Itàkal naa isal abɛ akyɛy kyà kà aben, làkyer kya u mpem aŋàbwaŋ, ntɔn Mwol, wɛɛ kà ntɔn baar anki. <verse eid="COL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24"/>Làyöb naa bɛ làsàwal làfur akà Mwol, la là kwal kàlɔ̈ɔ̈n nde ntɔn aŋikyɛɛl. Ntɔn Nkum a ndandaa làsyääl bɛ wà Klistɔ. <verse eid="COL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25"/>Mbuur mpa awà balàbal asàwal làfur a nkɔ̈ɔ̈n a balàbal ande, un'kɔl aŋàyɔŋ watɛy.<verse eid="COL 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1"/>Ankum, làkyer balàbal anà nkɔ̈ɔ̈n a nsöön akà asɔ abɛ, làyöb naa bɛ sye, bɛ làbye anà Nkum mwɛy u du.<verse eid="COL 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkääl akà baar abà u nsà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2"/>Làsi muküünà u ngyamàkà, amu ya, làkäl kà ikyɛɛŋ anà làfuur an'tɔɔn akà Nzam. <verse eid="COL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3"/>Mpal làyamà bɛ, làyamà sye ntɔn bi ntɔn Nzam kipɛ ipöl aŋàbwaŋ mulɔŋ ndaa ande, mukyään ngyee a Klistɔ, yà ntɔn ya in'wà mɛ u bɔlokà, <verse eid="COL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4"/>ntɔn mɛ in'sam ya ubwaŋàbwaŋ asànaa an'kwo mɛ musam ya.<verse eid="COL 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5"/>Abà, làkäl anà an'yeerà unsà nkääl abɛ akà baar mpa abà aklistɔ, anà làsyääl taaŋ. <verse eid="COL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6"/>Wɛy an'yääm abɛ màkäl màŋàbwaŋ taaŋ lanswà, màŋàsà muŋ, anà nkwaar mufuur akà mbuur wanswà.<verse eid="COL 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr a ntsüü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7"/>Tishik, un'tɔŋ wànkween, un'syääl mwɛy wàlää, un'baay amɛ unsà isal a Mwol, akyer ayàlasam làsaŋ amɛ lanswà. <verse eid="COL 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8"/>Mɛ, mɛ amàlatööm awà abun ntɔn mukàlasam làsaŋ abi anà mukàlalɛɛl. <verse eid="COL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9"/>Ɔnɛsim, un'tɔŋ wàlää anà nkween, umwɛy uboo a bɛ, wàmuyà mbwo mwɛy anà nde. Ba bàyàlasam indiir byanswà ikalyaaŋà kà.<verse eid="COL 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10"/>Aristark, awà u bɔlokà anà mɛ, kàmàlatööm mbɔr mbɔɔn, anà Malakɔ sye, un'tɔŋ a Barnabas. Bɛ làkyàwal nswɛɛŋ ntɔn nde : isàkal naa nde kan'yà akà bɛ, lun'wɛl ubwaŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="COL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11"/>Yɛsu awà bàfàbel Yüstüs, kàmàlatööm mbɔr. Ba mpɛl uboo a Ayudà abàmusal anà mɛ ntɔn Imwol a Nzam. Ba bàkäl ndɛɛl ntɔn mɛ.<verse eid="COL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12"/>Ɛpafras, nde sye wà umwɛy uboo abɛ, un'syääl a Klistɔ mpa afàyɔn munwaan ità u ngyamàkà ande, ntɔn bɛ làkäl bàŋàtsim, bàŋàbwaŋ, anà ntɔn muswaŋ ngyööl a an'kyän a ukwen a Nzam banswà. <verse eid="COL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13"/>Mɛ amun'tɛɛl imbäl ki naa nde afàsal ngwal mbɔɔn ntɔn bɛ, ntɔn baar a bul a Lawɔdisɛ anà bà bul a Yɛlapɔlis. <verse eid="COL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14"/>Lukà, un'ngaŋ, un'saam abi anà Dɛmas bàmàlatööm mbɔr.<verse eid="COL 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15"/>Apɛ atɔŋ abà u bul a Lawɔdisɛ mbɔr, anà Nɛmfa, anà Ikööŋ ifàköŋ u ndwà ande. <verse eid="COL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16"/>Mpal làsàmay bɛ mutaŋ un'kaan amɛ, làkyer mbwo yanswà naa bàtäŋ wa sye u Ikööŋ a Lawɔdisɛ. Làtäŋ sye anà wa akwà asàfà Lawɔdisɛ. <verse eid="COL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17"/>Abun, lun'kyään Arship naa: « Tà mpi isal kàwɛl ngye unsà Mwol, ntɔn ngye akwey kya ubwaŋàbwaŋ. »<verse eid="COL 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18"/>Le mbɔr a kɔɔ amɛ Pɔl yayi: Làyɔbà naa mɛ in'wà u bɔlokà. Wɛy kab a ngway a Nzam làkäl anà bɛ!<verse eid="COL 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4"/>
</usx>
